## 2. Feature log

### Authentication (`modules/auth.py`, `pages/login.py`, `pages/account.py`, `app.py`)
- [x] Create Account with validation (username 3-30 chars of letters/numbers/underscore, full name 2+ chars, valid email, password 8+ chars with a letter and a number, password confirmation, unique username stored in lowercase)
- [x] Login with PBKDF2-SHA256 hashing (200,000 rounds, random salt per user)
- [x] Account lock: 5 wrong passwords lock the account for 5 minutes
- [x] Same error message for unknown user and wrong password
- [x] Logged-out visitors only see the Login page (navigation hidden)
- [x] `require_login()` guard on every page
- [x] Logout from the sidebar (all pages) and from My Account; clears the whole session
- [x] My Account: profile view and change password (verifies current password first)

### Data import and preparation
- [x] CSV import for invoices and payments (`modules/csv_import.py`)
- [x] Validation: required columns, missing values, invalid or non-positive amounts, invalid dates, duplicate IDs (`modules/validation.py`)
- [x] Normalization of IDs, names, amounts (2 decimals) and dates (`modules/normalization.py`)
- [x] Duplicate payment detection: same description, amount and date (`modules/duplicates.py`)
- [x] Sample data loader (250 invoices, 250 payments, 20 customers)
- [x] Clear All Data with confirmation checkbox (accounts are kept)
- [x] Re-importing an existing ID updates the record; saved decisions are kept

### Matching (`modules/matching.py`)
- [x] Confidence score: 40% invoice reference, 30% customer name similarity, 20% exact amount, 10% date closeness
- [x] Date score tiers: within 1 day = 100, 3 days = 80, 7 days = 60, 14 days = 40, otherwise 0
- [x] Six statuses: High Confidence (85+ and exact amount), Needs Review (60+), Amount Mismatch, Ambiguous (top two within 10 points), Possible Duplicate, Unmatched
- [x] Plain-language explanation stored with each suggestion

### Reconciliation (`modules/reconciliation.py`, `pages/matching_review.py`)
- [x] Confirm allocation, reject suggestion, undo decision
- [x] Confirm All High Confidence in one click
- [x] Filters by status, decision and search text
- [x] Choose another invoice (only invoices with outstanding balance)
- [x] Allocation amount capped at the smaller of payment remainder and invoice outstanding
- [x] Decimal arithmetic and `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transaction lock when allocating

### Records and reports
- [x] Dashboard: 8 summary metrics, 2 charts, quick links, 5 most recent decisions
- [x] Balances: invoice, payment and customer tabs with filters
- [x] Allocation History: who decided, when, with undo
- [x] Reports: 5 CSV files (invoice balances, payment balances, matching suggestions, allocations, customer summary) with preview and download

