## 4. Known limitations and notes

- Anyone who can open the app can create an account. Add an approval step before any public deployment (also noted in the README).
- Users stay logged in until they press Logout or refresh the browser tab; the session is not kept across a refresh.
- Each payment can have only one allocation record (`payment_id` is unique in `allocations`).
- Matching compares every payment with every invoice, so run time grows with the product of the two record counts.
- The `reports/` folder is where generated CSV files are written.

